      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The hemorrhoidal thrombosis is an acute complication with no gravity but an emergency because of the severe pain. Oral or local medical treatments are rarely effective; they poorly relieve the pain. The realization of an incision with removal of the blood clot or of an excision is an easy procedure to perform in the consultation room. She brings an almost immediate pain relief. It only takes a few minutes and requires minimal equipment."},
